      "role": "user",
      "content": "i feel like im just a ghost. everything i worked for, all my friends, even just being able to walk down the street without feeling like everyone hates me... it's gone. i've been shut out by everyone. i dont think there's any way to come back from this. it's like i've already died, im just still walking around.",
